+class FreshnessGuard:
+    """Original lock on every call; complete handoff scan on bounded cadence.
+
+    Cadence is evaluated at guard boundaries, as in the accepted outer runtime.
+    A long blocking operation is followed by a due or explicitly forced check.
+    No timer thread, file cache, source omission or alternate identity is used.
